  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Remove cloning in-Game and make it a web based Cloning.\n\nSeems like cloning just opens more can of worms than it does bless anyone....but glorious to Avatar Thieves....\nWould mean that there be far fewer doors for them to grab avatars? \n\nWould also put your website to good use thru the world tabs thats its in and relieve the In-game world menu space...\nSure there are avatar worlds out there but what better way to advertise your model like how Toga's world did?\n\nWith cloning in game disabled or removed (prefered) would prevent any more avatar stealing and those that want to share their models has to load it up thru the web based or unity to web ( how ever that works ) to get them with Generated Public Avatar IDs while those Uploaded privately should be given with a encryption treatment or something of a sort like \" Cannot generate a Avatar ID Because Your Not The Owner of Model \" \n\n\n",
